# Mechanic: Energy acquisition and payment on a player.
# Forcing: Pummeler is the only spell and supplies exactly its activation cost.
# AI behavior: No hand or mana. The human owns every decision.
# Failure modes: Missing energy prevents activation. Unpaid cost leaves power unchanged.
# Card roles: Pummeler supplies and spends energy. Islands pay its generic cast cost.
# Protocol path: Player CounterAdded and current Counter total, then CounterRemoved and zero total.
[metadata]
Name:Player energy acquisition and payment
Goal:Survive
Turns:2
Difficulty:Easy
Description:Cast Electrostatic Pummeler, then spend its three energy counters to double its power.

